🎉 What's new in EzySplit 2.1.0

• Split expenses in any currency — pick your country when creating a group and every amount, balance, and export shows up in your currency, not just ₹
• Settling up outside India now confirms with a simple "mark as paid," since UPI only works within India
• PDF and Excel exports now display the correct currency for the group
• Fixed a rare issue where a slow or missing internet connection during sign-in could leave your account only half set up

Thanks for splitting with us! 💙
